 despite its high index because the humidity ageing test shows a 40% transparency loss, exceeding the 10% hard limit. Radiator-R3 passes ageing but has the lower index and gives less pion/kaon separation in the thickness scan. Among the ageing-qualified candidates, the simulated 10 GeV/c pion/kaon separation is maximized for Radiator-R1 at 6 cm and remains above the hard 3.5 sigma requirement.\",\"requirements\":[{\"requirement\":\"Achieve the best possible pion/kaon separation at 10 GeV/c.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Thickness scan over the allowed 1-6 cm range identifies Radiator-R1 at 6 cm as the best ageing-qualified option; increasing to the upper allowed thickness gives the largest photon statistics and the best simulated separation among candidates that pass the lifetime constraint.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The radiator must be one of the three candidates listed in candidate_specs.md.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"candidate_specs.md lists Radiator-R1, Radiator-R2, and Radiator-R3; the recommendation is Radiator-R1.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The pion/kaon separation at 10 GeV/c must be at least 3.5 sigma.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"The simulation scan for Radiator-R1 at 6 cm gives pion/kaon separation above 3.5 sigma at 10 GeV/c.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Transparency loss after a 10-year-equivalent humidity ageing test must not exceed 10%.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"ageing_tests.md reports Radiator-R1 transparency loss of 6% at 400 nm after the 10-year-equivalent humidity exposure, below the 10% limit. Radiator-R2 is 40% and is therefore excluded; Radiator-R3 is 3%.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Radiator thickness between 1 and 6 cm.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"The selected thickness is 6 cm, which is within the allowed interval.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Finish by submitting one recommended radiator and thickness.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Submitted one recommendation: Radiator-R1, 6 cm.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_783f847e470d4492bff89a3c4f061a99", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_00a219dd28fc4bb9006b0301a2337c87d0992462b9c4f516ac", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
